00:09:14.304 --> 00:09:17.705
It takes ten years at
something continuously

00:09:17.705 --> 00:09:19.249
to become great at it.

00:09:19.249 --> 00:09:21.351
And I stuck with it
for ten years straight,

00:09:21.351 --> 00:09:23.487
before I had a record
deal, before I had money

00:09:23.487 --> 00:09:24.904
before I had lights and camera

00:09:24.904 --> 00:09:27.433
before I had, you know,

00:09:27.433 --> 00:09:29.389
